    "measurementTechnique": [
      "Canopy reflectance spectra were measured with a SVC HR-1024i Spectroradiometer, w/ SVC reflectance probe (2014, 2015) or a Spectral Evolution PSR+_3500 Spectroradiometer (2016). Data were processed using a combination of R-FieldSpectra (Serbin, 2021) and spectrolab (Meireles & Schweiger, 2020), available from https://github.com/serbinsh/R-FieldSpectra and https://github.com/meireles/spectrolab respectively."
